<Base title="About PPRGaming"><div class="prose"><h1>About PPRGaming</h1>
<p><strong>PPRGaming — Perpetual Realm Gaming</strong> is an independent gaming news site run by James, a Star Citizen backer and daily player since 2013.</p>
<p>We cover news and updates for games we find genuinely interesting, with a dedicated <a href="/category/star-citizen/">Star Citizen Hub</a> for patch notes, events, ships and Squadron 42 progress.</p>
<h2>Editorial standards</h2><ul><li>Every news post links to its public sources.</li><li>Rumors and unconfirmed details are clearly labeled.</li><li>Affiliate and referral links are disclosed.</li><li>PPRGaming is not affiliated with Cloud Imperium Games or Roberts Space Industries.</li></ul>
<p>Follow us on X: <a href={SITE.x}>@PPRGamers</a>.</p>
